{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 870 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "bc6defc204c76a62f1e17067c82b94e21799b85ef9151f557c91151e70e25009" :edb/db-before-t 869 :edb/db-after-t 870 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534182 50 #inst "2026-10-11T17:30:10.126Z" 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124662 1038 #edb/ref 17592186413322 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124664 1038 #edb/ref 17592186413321 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124664 1038 #edb/ref 17592186413323 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124919 1068 #edb/ref 17592186122114 13194139534182 17592186045417 false] [17592186124919 1068 #edb/ref 17592186413318 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124919 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124919 1071 "What is the horizontal asymptote of $y = f(x)$ with $f(x) = \\frac{3x + 4}{6 - 15x}$?" 13194139534182 17592186045417 false] [17592186124919 1071 "What is the horizontal asymptote of $y=f(x)$ with $f(x)=\\frac{3x+4}{6-15x}?$" 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186124919 1074 "The horizontal asymptote is $y={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x).$ To find the horizontal asymptote, we apply the usual procedure of dividing the numerator and denominator by the highest power of $x$ in the denominator, which is $x.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{3x+4}{6-15x} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{3x}{x}+\\frac{4}{x})}{(\\frac{6}{x}-\\frac{15x}{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(3+\\frac{4}{x})}{(\\frac{6}{x}-15)} \\\\  & =\\frac{3+0}{0-15} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the horizontal asymptote is $y=-\\frac{1}{5}.$" 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186413301 1080 "y=-3" 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186413301 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186413301 1083 #uuid "0051830d-55e5-5121-b11a-0d87da7f40fb" 13194139534182 17592186045417 true] [17592186413